SEQUENCE:9
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 38min\n\nLower body + core workout that do not requi
 re any equipment. Aim for the last set to reach near failure. You can incr
 ease intensity with repetitions or adding weight.\n\nWorkout:\n • Warm U
 p — open\n3×\n   • Box Step-Ups — 20 reps\n   • Knee-Up Walking L
 unges — 20 reps (rest 60s)\n3×\n   • Split Bench Squat — 20 reps\n 
   • Balanced Kick Back — 20 reps\n   • Lie On One Leg Supine Hip And
  Knee — 20 reps (rest 60s)\n3×\n   • Seated Scissor Kicks — 15 reps
 \n   • Windshield Wiper — 15 reps\n   • Plank Step Ups — 15 reps (
 rest 60s)\n • Cool Down — open
END:VEVENT
